# Environment Configuration Example
# Copy this to .env and fill in your actual settings
# WARNING: Never commit .env file to version control!
# [HC-075] Values intentionally blank. Generate fresh keys per network with
#   blockchain-java/scripts/generate_keys.sh   and put them in .env (never commit .env).
